=+===+===+===+===+===+===+===+===+===+===+===+===+=
 catch dangerous migrations
 before they reach production

  migrail reads your migrations the way the database runs
  them. It reports statements that lock tables, rewrite them
  or break code that's still running, and shows how to fix
  each one.

  Usage
    migrail <command> [flags]

  Commands
    check       Check SQL migrations for locks, rewrites and breaking changes
    explain     Explain what a rule detects and how to fix it
    rules       List every rule with its severity and category
    version     Print the migrail version and build details

  Flags
        --ascii           use ASCII symbols instead
                          of Unicode
        --color string    use color: auto, always or
                          never (default "auto")
        --no-hyperlinks   don't print clickable file
                          links
        --theme string    color theme: auto, dark,
                          light or mono (default "auto")

  Run migrail <command> --help for details on a command.
